    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FOR SALE BY ONLINE AUCTION – 28TH OCTOBER 2026 AT 12 NOON.\r\n\r\nREMOTE BIDDING ONLY.  You must pre-register to bid on our website www.dpa.ie and follow the Offr tab. \r\n\r\nRegistration closes on 27th October 2026 at 4PM.\r\n\r\nCharming Traditional Stone-Built Farmhouse with Coach House on c. 1.18 Acres.\r\n\r\nDiscover the endless potential of this traditional stone-built farmhouse, perfectly situated along the R553 Listowel to Lisselton Road [KY77462F - Plan 8]. Offering a unique blend of heritage and convenience, the property sits on a generous 0.48-hectare (1.18-acre) mature site just 2km from Lisselton Cross and 6km from the heritage town of Listowel. The main residence is a character-filled 3-bedroom farmhouse complete with a kitchen, sitting room and two toilet facilities - the property has been vacant for more than two years and may qualify for vacant property grant etc...\r\n\r\nSteeped in rustic appeal, the grounds feature a magnificent detached two-storey stone coach house packed with original features, alongside traditional stone-built cow stalls and stores enclosing a classic cobble-lock yard. The property boasts direct gated vehicular and pedestrian access to the public road, offering seamless connectivity to the N69 Limerick/Killarney relief road. Located within a short drive of primary and secondary schools, as well as the breathtaking Ballybunion seaside resort and its world-famous golf courses, this mature site presents an unmatched opportunity for discerning buyers looking to create a dream countryside retreat."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance porch - 2.3m x 1.3m \r\nWith sliding door.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Living/Dining Room - 5.2m x 5.4m \r\nDual aspect with front and rear doorways, solid fuel Stanley range, fitted units and staircase to attic room. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 5.0m x 3.8m \r\nWith solid fuel open fireplace, walk-in wardrobe dressing area and ensuite with toilet and wash basin.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 5.0m x 4.6m \r\nDual aspect and feature woodburning stove.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 5.0m x 3.4m \r\nDual aspect with solid fuel open fireplace and fitted carpet.  \r\n\r\nEnsuite Shower Room - 2.8m x 2.8m \r\nComplete with shower, toilet and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.3m x 4.2m \r\nAttic room with gable window. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Traditional Stone built cow sheds with pitched and lean-to roofs and cobble lock yard - extending to70sqm\r\n\r\nTwo storey stone built coach house with red brick trim, arched doorway’s and loft potential extending to 90sqm offering amazing potential.\r\n\r\nOnsite septic tank.\r\n\r\nElectricity disconnected.\r\n\r\nGrants available if applicable."
